{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "256ef8c86252862d3ffe0f22c951e0bc5bd6719705b401db7ea807a842f0194a", "ja": "せつなさの理由", "zh": "伤感的理由", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "87703f1efc8ee1d9cd0003e31ac47160a348863c2a706864954fc96df2adfaf4", "ja": "全体リハが終わり、メンバーの歌声に惹かれ\nて、あずさが迷い込んでくる。せつない歌を\n歌えるのは、悲しい事を乗り越えたから？\nと尋ねるあずさに、麗花はピッケルのピッく\nんをなくした思い出を語るのだった。", "zh": "全体彩排结束后，被成员们的歌声吸引，梓迷迷糊糊地走了进来。梓问道，之所以能唱出如此悲伤的歌，是因为经历过并克服了悲伤的事情吗？丽花便讲起了自己弄丢冰镐小镐的回忆。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "94527d2ca76b08c0062ae0ece50f60e875376eb63ecc5b7f26303e7983673af5", "ja": "（いよいよ天体公演前日！　全体リハが終わり、\nアクアリウスの3人は手応えを感じているようだ）", "zh": "（终于到了天体公演的前一天！全体彩排结束后，水瓶座的3名成员似乎都感受到了成果。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "b37d53b47789b200d3ada4b88c3bfd2e857834b11eac3e4de0438e0456517ad4", "ja": "レイ、サヨ！\n今の、バッチリだったよな！？", "zh": "丽，纱代！\n刚才那段，配合得特别完美吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "a9b6048288f927dd9c06bf35e1fb49f3d9784d82daddc303842a10001934598a", "ja": "うんっ、私達の歌声がピッタリ重なって、\n終わりもピッタリで！", "zh": "嗯，我们的歌声配合得天衣无缝，连结尾也恰到好处！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1003_048rei", "source_sha256": "60c29a5647fd20505613134602ca79d58ed5175f27c56405566cf91090342820", "ja": "ふふっ、とっても楽しく歌えたね！　この調子で、\n本番のMCもどっかんどっかん盛り上げようね♪", "zh": "呵呵，唱得特别开心呢！就照这个状态，把正式演出的MC也炒得热热闹闹吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1004_p", "source_sha256": "45f8e9c986f641bb6d2c1affe65410d60fed216f5623b814a3fc2be7e88616cb", "ja": "……ん、あれ？\nあの客席にいるのは……。", "zh": "……嗯，咦？\n坐在那边观众席上的人是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1006_p", "source_sha256": "d8b4a2aa97c5fdfa06c5ec58815b21a4c6b34b032c2a2a5c32503958f62b0a5d", "ja": "あずささーん！　どうしたんですかー？", "zh": "秋月小姐！您怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1007_010azu", "source_sha256": "fe8400f9354c0f63974fe7cfa0ff350e9fc3cedfae7577cd44dfe4c3b642668f", "ja": "あらあら、見付かってしまいました。\nお疲れさまです～。", "zh": "哎呀呀，被发现了呢。\n辛苦了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1008_010azu", "source_sha256": "9bc1bfaf6c03526c222bb051e6d837bfab4b85ac49cc68f20c147d12d11e11da", "ja": "とっても素敵な歌が聞こえてきたものですから、\nつい、誘い込まれてしまって……うふふ♪", "zh": "因为听到了特别美妙的歌声，\n不知不觉就被吸引过来了……呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "c01abece30fe76ee46865947d3aff64203373d94a5729d99b3489e5d3d346feb", "ja": "わあ……あずささん、聴いてくれてたんですね！\nありがとうございます！", "zh": "哇……原来是梓姐姐在听啊！\n谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "1a0eb7e7968ab7c8f23764075efb6b53ade11aed1d5210ae5e864eb56a630bc4", "ja": "ははっ、あず姉がそう言ってくれるなら、\n間違いなさそうだな。サンキュ、あず姉！", "zh": "哈哈，既然阿梓姐都这么说了，\n那肯定没错了。谢啦，阿梓姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1011_010azu", "source_sha256": "7896778e88a8be6218ca8210f81e949ba3a0e3b61ea8dde4a4b64ee6dc46d400", "ja": "本当に素敵だったのよ？　私、ちょっと泣いちゃった\nくらい。みんな、歌が上手なのね？", "zh": "真的非常精彩哦？我都差点感动得哭出来了。大家都很擅长唱歌呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1012_027say", "source_sha256": "a4aa97c6546fc117cde40ef0261c5b05764a1b5354f71930b250d8ef790f078d", "ja": "そ、そんなこと……。あ、でも、麗花さんなんて、\n最初から上手だったんですよ！", "zh": "才、才不是那样……啊，不过，丽花可是从一开始就很厉害了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1013_050jul", "source_sha256": "22fcf4f8c52af4f14e35292e71467de49b2d12726b5883f8859a311b4da15fa9", "ja": "ああ、あたしとサヨは、けっこう苦労したけど。\nレイは最初っから飛ばしてたもんな！", "zh": "啊，我和纱代可是吃了不少苦头。不过丽花一开始就势头十足呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1014_010azu", "source_sha256": "dfbf7a6db925ffa59bd5268c8e4c8267388ec39635d345190464b26a6253715e", "ja": "まあっ、そうなの！\n麗花ちゃん、すごいのね～。", "zh": "哎呀，原来是这样！丽花真厉害呀～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1015_048rei", "source_sha256": "325b8d5f704d11d0a0e9a0e7ece959d9326d098a1dd81f6546fd79c966b41df9", "ja": "えっへん♪　それほどでもないですけど、\n褒められたので、自慢しちゃいます♪", "zh": "嘿嘿♪也没有那么厉害啦，不过既然被夸了，我就得意一下咯♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1016_010azu", "source_sha256": "94cafd07a35fb0284acbebe6839bfbf86c2544d16e4a7f3aa742f73b32cc1d87", "ja": "でも、あんなにせつない歌を、\nあんなに上手に歌えるなんて……。", "zh": "但是，竟然能把那么悲伤的歌，唱得那么好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1017_010azu", "source_sha256": "6f253872c6aed2b15f14b98701bcbe8c53cb96b5a10b5621db01a586a4bca5ae", "ja": "きっと麗花ちゃんは、とっても悲しいことを乗り越えて\nきたのね。だから、すぐに上手に歌えて……。", "zh": "丽花一定是克服了非常悲伤的事情吧。所以才能马上唱得那么好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "067800eab989bbf31d67e9045c18bf6573b45cb728d5893bb6aa0244d751efb5", "ja": "……。\nレイ、そうだったのか？", "zh": "……。\n丽，是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1019_048rei", "source_sha256": "2b3c8c28382fb9c7cda7aacc66ae94edfe3150f618b6bf613a20fcb00f6e87df", "ja": "えっ、そうだったんですか？", "zh": "咦，是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1020_027say", "source_sha256": "22fa13ebfeb9f22f505544a5e0d8bdc43f1b526eb24b3dbd026b108f75070132", "ja": "あずささん、違うみたいです！", "zh": "秋月小姐，好像不是那样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1021_010azu", "source_sha256": "81bd80f5eececbc09dd58c2cf6b52fa0bc401484a4fac3e465e7124aa133d878", "ja": "あ、あらあら、どうしましょう～。私、すっかり\n勘違いしてしまって……ごめんなさい、麗花ちゃんっ。", "zh": "啊、哎呀呀，这可怎么办呀～我完全误会了……对不起，丽花。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1022_048rei", "source_sha256": "17085ea9bb6ce7f50b41be6ec15b43e32a27453f61f5bc60197845c21332ece4", "ja": "あっ、そうだ！　あずささん、きっと正解です♪\n私、とっても悲しいことを乗り越えちゃいました！", "zh": "啊，对了！梓小姐肯定答对了♪\n我已经克服了非常悲伤的事情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1023_010azu", "source_sha256": "66c714f861491e93dd652d49c236b07517a733b4bc2a77f13566d37544de3983", "ja": "ま、まあ。やっぱり……！", "zh": "没、没错。果然……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1024_050jul", "source_sha256": "fdcf11538da2ad09027a9c77bcf32fbcdc59f515710a6e7247d20e938ccc1a97", "ja": "……そのわりに軽くないか？", "zh": "……不过这也太轻浮了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1025_048rei", "source_sha256": "10e4be5a18508cdf1cf89a8d796bdc327f08246afb6a64243afdc3ecb61c2376", "ja": "あのね、ジュリアちゃん。私、今回の歌は、\nピッくんの気持ちになって歌ってた気がするの！", "zh": "那个呀，茱莉亚。我感觉自己这次唱歌时，好像是代入了皮克的心情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1026_050jul", "source_sha256": "a552d89ba518acb661cffe321c1f5dce3edae1051f9221ba58d5722733617370", "ja": "ピッくん……。って、誰だよ？", "zh": "皮酱……。等等，谁啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1027_048rei", "source_sha256": "d6ef9f47c270b7f265c5d039d38457c9cf8c93b48193a93b8faa67d2e73ba554", "ja": "ピッくんはピッくんだよ？\n私が大好きだった、ピッケルのピッくん！", "zh": "小皮克就是小皮克呀？  \n我最喜欢的那把冰镐，小皮克！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1028_050jul", "source_sha256": "c76071fc49d670b833e5b852a58d5c0b37577977796395b22c26d473fe4c2f15", "ja": "ピッケル……！", "zh": "冰镐……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1029_027say", "source_sha256": "c76071fc49d670b833e5b852a58d5c0b37577977796395b22c26d473fe4c2f15", "ja": "ピッケル……！", "zh": "冰镐……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1030_010azu", "source_sha256": "c76071fc49d670b833e5b852a58d5c0b37577977796395b22c26d473fe4c2f15", "ja": "ピッケル……！", "zh": "冰镐……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1031_p", "source_sha256": "1e61cc4a53f75db5eccc704c59e08f3534811abcae25b1e68463d4ff39bb70ed", "ja": "ピッケルって、あの山登りに使うピッケルだよな……。\n麗花は山登りが好きだから、つまり……愛用の？", "zh": "镐，是登山用的那种镐吧……\n丽花喜欢登山，所以也就是说……是她常用的那把？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1032_048rei", "source_sha256": "c2b3eabef2cd6f39a61f993337896966ecc5667ad5f0bc4c117ab4e596f623d1", "ja": "そうですそうです。どこの山に行くにも一緒だった、\nなんていうか、相棒みたいな子で。", "zh": "对对，就是那个登山用的冰镐。无论去爬哪座山，它都一直陪着我……怎么说呢，就像是我的搭档一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1033_048rei", "source_sha256": "0f6fa663a8c93f6eb143d7fa040e2226495bdccd016ce7900439d6a27ff6ddf2", "ja": "でも、ある日山に登ってたら……。私の不注意で、\nスポーンって、谷底に落ちていっちゃって……。", "zh": "可是，有一天爬山的时候……因为我的一时疏忽，它“嗖”地一下掉进谷底去了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1035_050jul", "source_sha256": "321a3f5fa6a5fc58874d0aade1298658861624e92c122ea05c0c1d7ac9ce2ba4", "ja": "落としたのか。", "zh": "就这么掉下去了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1036_048rei", "source_sha256": "c67b2b7ae62470cb314ce09cf7b4479f31bdc085f3eba1581716770a99595e26", "ja": "ピッくん、今どうしてるんだろう。\n……元気に、してるかなぁ。", "zh": "Pikkun现在怎么样了呢。\n……还好吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1037_048rei", "source_sha256": "ed78ed37b0bec2f2f1c1cc770cde80545df717269b8cc4753dc7747ba4ddcc5e", "ja": "誰もこない谷底で、ひとりぼっちで……\n暗くて、寒くて……ずっと、ひとりぼっち……。", "zh": "在谁都不会来的谷底，一个人孤零零地……\n又黑，又冷……一直都是孤零零的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1038_048rei", "source_sha256": "a61e00e5ec9ab1d730a04cd3c71504f3f6523580ff1a9841c2568e58cca6fce5", "ja": "…………ぐすっ。", "zh": "…………呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1039_p", "source_sha256": "263d6ec335774ed7e007916b19b57ffca513cc0696b0ee53411e56898cb4252b", "ja": "れ、麗花！？", "zh": "丽、丽花！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1040_048rei", "source_sha256": "052d13cc710572278a2b15fbcfd98e5bac2883379ac35f2d01abf7b67e674bf4", "ja": "……えへへ。でも、もうしょうがないことなんです。\n気持ちを……切り替えないとですね！", "zh": "……诶嘿嘿。不过，这也是没办法的事啦。\n必须……转换一下心情才行呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1041_010azu", "source_sha256": "9af885c5f1395f73373abb66ee2c44375194ec979d89ea256663c9ad7a7974c3", "ja": "麗花ちゃん……。\nやっぱり、とっても寂しい思いをしていたのね。", "zh": "丽花……。果然，你一直都非常寂寞呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1042_050jul", "source_sha256": "cb2db615bf8a4a9e9dc91b30ce549192b81774191bd26e0efcaa3d13c7aea276", "ja": "まあ……わかる気もするよ。\nあたしもギターとか、谷底に落としたら……うん。", "zh": "倒也不是……不能理解啦。\n要是我把吉他什么的掉到谷底去的话……嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1043_027say", "source_sha256": "50705f696047fb8c8a16cd434602d83849910809f5f994c9067544b74cef1da1", "ja": "谷底でひとりぼっち、って思うと……\nそれは、せつないですよね……。ぐすっ。", "zh": "一想到孤零零地待在谷底……确实会让人觉得很难过呢……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1044_048rei", "source_sha256": "6307541ebbdfff87873fc9e6101db8c1edf1ed94db96e895498b8e0b0c5d1382", "ja": "……あっ、ごめんなさい！\nピッくんのことは、もういいんです！", "zh": "……啊，对不起！\n小皮的事情，已经没关系了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1045_048rei", "source_sha256": "4f97de38c651d2f0304e16eb0dcac51a589fe726c852e194930f62245f456d5b", "ja": "明日はせっかくの天体公演なんですから！\n私がこんな湿っぽくなってる場合じゃないですし！", "zh": "明天可是难得的天体公演！\n我可不能在这种时候变得这么多愁善感！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1046_048rei", "source_sha256": "a146267f9ff6e9e2a6952625d0c833c778c628f6eee8c32645db179e3c82a59b", "ja": "天体公演、頑張るぞー、おーっ！\nほら、ジュリアちゃんも紗代子ちゃんも！　おーっ！！", "zh": "天体公演，要加油啦～，哦——！\n来，茱莉亚和纱代子也一起！哦——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1047_050jul", "source_sha256": "ecbc68fbc626eed268d143e361d33d82065d998ef24287d123b273fe3f8e51b7", "ja": "……そうだな。明日は思いっきり歌って……。\nウチらの歌、どこまでも届けようぜ！", "zh": "……也是啊。明天就尽情歌唱……\n把我们的歌声，传达到天涯海角吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1048_027say", "source_sha256": "1bf6109594d5aab385e067011e037a834795a1aa9f379d60a25bdaf11cb8c6e7", "ja": "おーっ！！\nみんなで、最高の公演にしましょうね！", "zh": "哦——！！\n大家一起努力，打造最棒的演出吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1049_p", "source_sha256": "07b840f6a507308ac3981ef2ad9b52bc77c2dc10d994bf80383a795b65c92ada", "ja": "（ただピッケルをなくしただけ……なんて、\n麗花のあの様子を見たら、とても言えない）", "zh": "（看到丽花那副样子，我实在说不出口那只是弄丢了镐头……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0108_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_06_1050_p", "source_sha256": "ae725c2dba29b7e2e8372980eceb44fc47b71c7f8a010efabf622408ea13d1b6", "ja": "（ピッくんを思いやる麗花の優しさ……その情感を、\nファンのみんなにも、しっかり届けないとな！）", "zh": "（丽花体谅小镐的温柔……这份感情也一定要好好传达给所有粉丝才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
